    "body": "Reopened. The merge of #3823 (`ed6f980ef`, 06:19:28Z) closed this issue from the line `Fixes #3746` in the PR body.\n\nPin 5 is not met on that head. `crates/motion/src/machining2d/air_entry.rs:233-243` emits named helix and ramp stand-ins, and that work moves to #3748.\n\nThe done criterion of this issue says: \"the five pins are green\". Pin 5 (`start_side_entries_have_no_helix_or_ramp`) is open, so this issue is open.\n\nClose this issue again in one of two ways:\n1. pin 5 is green, or\n2. a comment on this issue says that #3748 replaces pin 5, and the done criterion is changed.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
